              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The most versatile block of all is the open block. It allows you to apply block attributes to a chunk of text without giving it any other semantics. In other words, it provides a generic structural container for enclosing content. The only notable limitation is that an open block cannot be nested inside of another open block."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
